  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们把一直角分成90等份，就得到90个合同的角（图215）。每一个小角等于直角的$\\frac{1}{90}$。一个直角的九十分之一叫做一度，并把它作为度量角的单位。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 199,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0208#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-215",
      "label": "图 215",
      "printed_page": 199,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0208#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "一个直角的$\\frac{1}{90}$叫做一度。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 199,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0208#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图215",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 215",
      "printed_page": 199,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0208#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果角$MOP$包含40度，那么就说角$MOP$的大小等于40度，写作：$\\widehat{MOP}=40^{\\circ}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 199,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0208#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "“$^{\\circ}$”是角的度量单位——度的符号。应当分清楚$\\angle MOP$和$\\widehat{MOP}$这两种写法。第一种写法读作“角$MOP$”，而第二种写法读作“角$MOP$的大小”。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 199,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0208#12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "直角的大小等于$90^{\\circ}$，而平角的大小等于$180^{\\circ}$。任何锐角都小于$90^{\\circ}$，而任何钝角都大于$90^{\\circ}$小于$180^{\\circ}$。如果角$ABC$是锐角，而角$KED$是钝角，那么下列不等式就是真的：$\\widehat{ABC}<90^{\\circ}$，$90^{\\circ}<\\widehat{KED}<180^{\\circ}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 199,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0208#13",
        "p0209#1"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
